[[2047,15,32768,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is controlled by the ignition (INT)from\nthe line for fuse  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               for the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : when\nthe brake pedal is pressed, the switch closes and sends the operating\nsignal to the check device inside the rev counter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 5\nof connector A).</p><p>The supply for the check device inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives\ndirectly from the battery (maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up\nto 2/99 or of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99) to pins 10 and 16 of connector\nA, through fuses \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F3</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\n the former protects the circuits for the lights on the left-hand\nside, the latter those on the right.</p><p>The check device thereby controls the supply\n(pin 18 and pin 13 of connector A) for the side brake lights in\nthe rear light clusters \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F31</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>In the case of failures in the circuit,\nthe &quot;lights failure&quot; warning light - inside \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               -\ncomes on, with the supply controlled by the ignition (IINT), pin\n15 of connector A, of the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to\n2/99 or by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from\n2/99.</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends the signal for\noperating the centre rear light cluster \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               via the junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 18, connector D and pin 14 of connector E).</p><p>The braking signal for the switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I30</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsent from the switch to the ABS (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234769\">E7020</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              )\nand - on some versions - to the engine management control unit as\nwell (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234515\">E5030</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              or \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234559\">E5050</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p>"]]